  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7571757542ed0224f8e12029ec7658e4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BookText_Test Womans World
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BookText
  _bookContent: "She\u2019s tried all the angles. At this point, what can she do
    to redeem herself to the fans?\r\n\r\nI\u2019m happy no one has discovered her
    secret yet, but on the other hand, I don\u2019t understand how she just can\u2019t
    seem to redeem herself to the fans. She\u2019s tried all the angles to be relevant
    again, and it\u2019s just never right.\r\n\r\nShe\u2019s generously given her
    time and wisdom to aspiring singers in American Idol, she\u2019s written beautiful
    political and feminist anthems like Woman\u2019s World and Chained to the Rhythm.
    She went to space to break the glass ceiling for little girls everywhere who
    dream of being astronauts.\r\n\r\nMaybe we\u2019re being egotistical. Her albums
    keep flopping one after the other. Even if we can\u2019t explain why, clearly
    the fans are not satisfied with this version of Katy Perry. Maybe we should give
    them back the original."
